{"3855020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Sea", "steam_appid": 3855020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Sea is a spooky adventure story game where you pilot an old rusty soviet research submarine known as<i> P27</i> in search of the missing research team from the ODISEA Group.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as Mr. Sidorov, a mechanic working for the secretive Soviet research group known as O.D.I.S.EA. You know little about the organization—only that your job is to maintain personal, one-man submarines used by the primary research team to explore deep fissures in the sea floor, known as Fractures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After the detonation of the Tsar Bomba, a new Fracture—designated Fracture 17—opened in the nearby Kara Sea. Now, you've been called upon to pilot an old prototype submarine in search of the missing research team that vanished into Fracture 17 and lost all contact.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/f20192fa1d8a952bd06f33f0480356f2.poster.avif?t=1759949282\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/f20192fa1d8a952bd06f33f0480356f2.webm?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/f20192fa1d8a952bd06f33f0480356f2.mp4?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep beneath the Earths surface in search of your missing research team. Uncover the secrets of what they were searching for, and why they vanished. &quot;Seek not, that which you do not wish to behold.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/5872a7da6c5773a7af6a3f80c15748b8.poster.avif?t=1759949282\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/5872a7da6c5773a7af6a3f80c15748b8.webm?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/5872a7da6c5773a7af6a3f80c15748b8.mp4?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire illumination flares for visibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy tracking beacons to aid navigation and avoid getting lost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take photos of anything unusual or anomalous</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dock at stations to resupply</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use sonar to see the unseen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Beacons to Triangulate energy sources and stabilize anomalies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/6ef1cc1bb86849c243de050b8e0ac45a.poster.avif?t=1759949282\" width=758 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/6ef1cc1bb86849c243de050b8e0ac45a.webm?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/6ef1cc1bb86849c243de050b8e0ac45a.mp4?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Sea is a spooky adventure story game where you pilot an old rusty soviet research submarine known as<i> P27</i> in search of the missing research team from the ODISEA Group.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as Mr. Sidorov, a mechanic working for the secretive Soviet research group known as O.D.I.S.EA. You know little about the organization—only that your job is to maintain personal, one-man submarines used by the primary research team to explore deep fissures in the sea floor, known as Fractures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After the detonation of the Tsar Bomba, a new Fracture—designated Fracture 17—opened in the nearby Kara Sea. Now, you've been called upon to pilot an old prototype submarine in search of the missing research team that vanished into Fracture 17 and lost all contact.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/f20192fa1d8a952bd06f33f0480356f2.poster.avif?t=1759949282\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/f20192fa1d8a952bd06f33f0480356f2.webm?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/f20192fa1d8a952bd06f33f0480356f2.mp4?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep beneath the Earths surface in search of your missing research team. Uncover the secrets of what they were searching for, and why they vanished. &quot;Seek not, that which you do not wish to behold.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/5872a7da6c5773a7af6a3f80c15748b8.poster.avif?t=1759949282\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/5872a7da6c5773a7af6a3f80c15748b8.webm?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/5872a7da6c5773a7af6a3f80c15748b8.mp4?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire illumination flares for visibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy tracking beacons to aid navigation and avoid getting lost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take photos of anything unusual or anomalous</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dock at stations to resupply</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use sonar to see the unseen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Beacons to Triangulate energy sources and stabilize anomalies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/6ef1cc1bb86849c243de050b8e0ac45a.poster.avif?t=1759949282\" width=758 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/6ef1cc1bb86849c243de050b8e0ac45a.webm?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/6ef1cc1bb86849c243de050b8e0ac45a.mp4?t=1759949282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "When the research team from the classified Soviet organization known as O.D.I.S.E.A. went radio silent during an expedition deep beneath the Earth, you - a simple mechanic - were called upon to pilot an old prototype submarine and search for any trace of what happened and where they might have gone.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/282a31d61a3dbf12b3c228ede39d735bed3f25a0/header.jpg?t=1759949282", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/b24ca564f241632eee0b32c4ffcbb347e76d6ded/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759949282", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/b24ca564f241632eee0b32c4ffcbb347e76d6ded/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759949282", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 8700k or equivelent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["DarkSignal Studios"], "publishers": ["DarkSignal Studios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 99, "final": 99, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$0.99"}, "packages": [1355369], "package_groups"